{'symbol': 'INVH', 'date': '2021-09-23 22:27:00', 'title': 'INVITATION HOMES PRICES EQUITY OFFERING', 'text': 'DALLAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INVITATION HOMES INC. (NYSE: INVH) (“INVITATION HOMES” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE PRICING OF AN OFFERING OF 12,500,000 SHARES OF INVITATION HOMES COMMON STOCK AT A PRICE TO THE PUBLIC OF $40.00 PER SHARE. AS PART OF THE OFFERING, INVITATION HOMES HAS GRANTED THE UNDERWRITERS A 30-DAY OPTION TO PURCHASE UP TO AN ADDITIONAL 1,875,000 SHARES OF COMMON STOCK. THE OFFERING IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE ON SEPTEMBER 28, 2021, SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS. INVITAT'}